      ],
      "entries": [
        "40 feet. All creatures within the aura who have at least one past life (including all PCs in Season of Ghosts) recall failures in their past lives and are bolstered against repeating them, gaining a +1 status bonus to saving throws against mental effects. Living, non-nindoru|SoG2 creatures within the aura feel the pain of all their past lives, as well as their own current pain when they endure mental attacks, and gain weakness 3 to mental damage."
